BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Legends Awards
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T200000
DTSTAMP:20261109T222818Z
UID:dothebay-17885641@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:The Academy SF presents\nLegends Awards\n\nSunday\, November 2
 2 | The Castro\n\nThe Academy’s annual Legends Awards returns November 2
 2 for a night of celebration and giving thanks at the iconic Castro Theatr
 e. The Legends Awards honors extraordinary people whose contributions have
  shaped San Francisco’s LGBTQ+ community and whose stories deserve a per
 manent place in its history.\n\nThis year\, we celebrate our allies by pre
 senting Speaker Emerita Nancy Pelosi with the evening’s highest honor. S
 he is joined by community award recipients Mark Leno\, Gael Lala-Chávez\,
  and Angel Adeyoha.\n\nAn incredible lineup of special guests\, led by Sis
 ter Roma and fashion designer Zac Posen\, will also include Music Director
  Russell Deason\, Donna Sachet\, Honey Davenport\, and performances by Edu
 ardo González-Maldonado and Leanne Borghesi.\n\nJoin us Sunday\, November
  22\, for a night of giving thanks to the leaders\, builders\, artists\, a
 dvocates\, and allies who have made our community what it is today—and c
 ontinue to shape what comes next.\n\npecial thanks to Exclusive Promotiona
 l Media Sponsor\, the San Francisco Bay Times.\n\nA portion of the proceed
 s from the event will benefit True North\, a brand new non profit organiza
 tion that supports young people by providing social connections and experi
 ences as they enter the queer community.\n\n$73.50-$415\, All Ages\nThe Ac
 ademy SF presents\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/legends-awards-
 261122\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/22/legends-awards-tic
 kets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35407295/d117db47-170b-44dd-9e7f-b4f2fee64387.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T222818Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/22/legends-awards-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Programa de gestión de contingencias en español
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T113000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17732848@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:¿Le interesa cambiar\, reducir\, reevaluar o dejar de consumi
 r estimulantes como la metanfetamina o la cocaína?\n\nOfrecemos un progra
 ma de gestión de contingencias en español en nuestra agencia asociada\, 
 el Proyecto Gubbio.\n\nEste programa es un programa de refuerzo positivo d
 e 12 semanas/24 sesiones con servicios médicos\, asesoramiento individual
 \, gestión de casos y grupo de apoyo\, y todos los servicios se brindan e
 n español.\n\nPara obtener más información o unirse al grupo\, comuníq
 uese con Maricruz al 415-632-9722 o envíe un correo electrónico a mmoren
 o@sfaf.org.\n\n___________\n\nContingency management program in Spanish\n\
 nInterested in changing\, reducing\, re-evaluating\, or stopping your use 
 of stimulants such as meth or cocaine?\n\nWe offer a contingency managemen
 t program in Spanish at our partner agency\, the Gubbio Project.\n\nThis p
 rogram is a positive reinforcement 12 week/24-session program with medical
  services\, individual counseling\, case management\, and support group wi
