DESCRIPTION:Event Canceled\n\nCome find your snuggle buddy\, your winter f
 ling\, or your fuck buddy for the cold months ahead.\n\nNetfux and Chill: 
 Cuffing Season at The Kink Store\nHosted by Danarama\nSat 11/28 · 7pm–m
 idnight · The Kink Store\, 224 6th St\, SF\n\nThanksgiving is passed\, th
 e leftovers won't last\, and your non-chosen families are leaving at last.
  The nights are getting longer\, the air is getting colder\, and everyone'
 s looking for someone to keep them warm. Welcome to cuffing season.\nCome 
 find your snuggle buddy\, your Winter fling\, or your fuck buddy for the c
 old months ahead. The Kink Store is turning into one big cozy den: piles o
 f pillows\, warm red light\, hot tasty drinks and snacks\, and "Netfux" pl
 aying on the big screen. Bring your partner(s)\, or come solo and see who 
 you end up cuddled up with. They'll be meet-mixer games\, bondage basics d
 emos and tastings\, plenty of room to practice and play\, and Kink Store t
 oys to try or to buy (with lingering Black Friday deals).\n\nCome\, get co
 mfy\, get close\, and get cuffed.\n\n$48.24 to $90.24\nDanarama\n\nTickets
 : https://kinkpresents.com/e/73a817a8-90fd-4326-9f18-ad6e70b43522\nDetails
 : https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/28/netfux-and-chill-cuffing-season-a
 t-the-kink-store-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
