SUMMARY:“Inscribe 2026” SF’s World AIDS Day Chalk Memorial (Castro)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T210000
DTSTAMP:20261118T115305Z
UID:funcheap-1647818@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:INSCRIBE 2026: World AIDS Day Chalk Memorial (Castro)INSCRIBE 
 2026 is a World AIDS Day remembrance in San Francisco’s Castro neighborh
 ood honoring people who died of AIDS\, including 15\,000 former Castro res
 idents. From 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM\, participants can use provided rainbow ch
 alk to write names on the 400 and 500 blocks of Castro Street alongside th
 e Rainbow Honor Walk plaques. A short program is scheduled for noon\, and 
 the Sisters of Perpetual Indulgence have been invited to participate.\n\nY
 ou are warmly invited to INSCRIBE\, our World AIDS Day remembrance in The 
 Castro neighborhood of San Francisco on December 1\, 2026\n\nINSCRIBE hono
 rs and celebrates those who died of AIDS\, especially the 15\,000 men and 
 women who called The Castro home. In their memory\, we INSCRIBE their name
 s in brightly colored rainbow chalk on the sidewalks of the 400 and 500 bl
 ocks of Castro St.\, alongside The Rainbow Honor Walk’s permanent bronze
  plaques honoring gay and civil rights heroes.\n\nThroughout the day\, fro
 m 9:00 a.m. to 9:00 p.m. the chalk will be available. We gather at 18th an
 d Castro Sts. with reverence\, joy\, and sadness. Everyone is welcome to I
 NSCRIBE names using chalk provided by Cliff’s Variety and placed in colo
 rful pails along the sidewalk. Participation is free and INSCRIBE is not a
  fundraiser.\n\nA short program will take place at noon. We have invited T
 he Sisters of Perpetual Indulgence to participate again this year\, and we
  hope they will bless the event during the program and invok...\n\nFree\n\
 nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/groups/HONORINGOUREXPERIENCE/posts/2991
 1692478433045\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/inscribe-2026-sfs-world-ai
 ds-day-chalk-memorial-castro/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/895310
 953_29706146302336352_3065737990551384270_n.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:18th and Castro Sts.\, 18th St & Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/inscribe-2026-sfs-world-aids-day-chalk-memoria
 l-castro/
END:VEVENT
