DESCRIPTION:All I want for Christmas is fierce diva pop! Mash the halls!\n
 \nSleigh bells? Slayyy\, belles! Bootie Mashup kicks off the holidaze with
  a naughty\, filthy\, fabulous pop party\, mashing up your favorite divas:
  Slayyyter\, ADÉLA\, Charli xcx\, Lady Gaga\, Kesha\, Chappell Roan\, Sab
 rina Carpenter\, Kim Petras\, Addison Rae\, Britney Spears\, Doechii\, Rih
 anna\, and of course\, freshly de-thawed for the season\, Mariah Carey.\n\
 nThe Monster Show will be bringing the most fucked-up Christmas drag numbe
 rs you've ever seen\, and we promise this party won't get you eliminated f
 rom Whamageddon!\n\n• TWO ROOMS of dancing to fierce diva pop and select
  holiday bangers\n\n• Main Room DJs: ADRIANA A\, DJ TYME\n\n• Front Ro
 om DJs: DJ DADA\, DJ JIMI G (with live guitar mashups!)\n\n• Pop-up drag
  & burlesque by: THE MONSTER SHOW\nfeaturing DOT COMME as Slayyyter & BONI
 TA ROSE as ADÉLA\n\n• Coat Check Girl XTINE NOIR’s Birthday!\n\n• F
 estive\, trashy holiday fits encouraged! Slutty Santa Mean Girls\, naughty
  elves\, ugly sweaters\, glitter and tinsel!\n\n• Dance on our go-go box
 es! Unhinged video projections!\n\nShowcasing the best mashups in the worl
 d ever\, Bootie Mashup has been throwing genre-fluid dance parties since 2
 003\, shamelessly combining pop songs both throwback and current. With cre
 ative themes\, mashed-up music tributes\, and fun drag shows\, our crew of
  pop pirates have helped shape nightlife in San Francisco and beyond for o
 ver two decades.\n\n$10\, 21+\nBootie Mashup presents\n\nTickets: https://
 consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fslayyy-bel
 ls-bootie-mashup-tickets-2004407414534%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: htt
 ps://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/5/bootie-mashup-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
