DESCRIPTION:Future Bars\n\nSantas\, elves & Grinches welcome! SantaCon tak
 es over Claude Lane with DJs\, holiday cocktails from The Merriest & festi
 ve chaos.\n\nHo ho ho\, it’s SantaCon on Claude Lane.\nSantaCon is back 
 where it all started. Our very first block party on Claude Lane was SantaC
 on\, and this year we’re bringing it home to Shotski’s during The Merr
 iest\, our annual Christmas pop-up.\n\nPut on your best Santa suit\, elf e
 ars or ugly sweater and join us for a full day of holiday chaos on the lan
 e:\nHoliday cocktails from The Merriest menu\nDJs all day: 1-8pm Mojo & Ja
 e Coco 8pm-12am: Cshay\nDrink specials\nPhoto ops\n🥟 Brazilian empanada
 s by Andrea Lobo Catering\, hot and fresh on the lane\nWhether Shotski’s
  is your first stop of the day or your last\, Claude Lane is the place to 
 be this SantaCon.\nFree entry. RSVP to get on the list.\n21+ only. Valid I
 D required.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/santacon-bloc
 k-party-on-claude-lane-shotskis-x-the-merriest-tickets-2005097313039?aff=o
 ddtdtcreator&amp\;keep_tld=true\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/santacon
 -block-party-claude-lane-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
