DESCRIPTION:History is being made on 11th Street!\n\nNEW YEARS DAY SUNRISE
  STREET FAIR\n\nThis New Year's Day\, San Francisco's nightlife community 
 comes together to create the first-ever block party and music festival on 
 11th Street. For one day only\, the heart of the city's entertainment dist
 rict transforms into a massive open-air celebration featuring 100+ DJs\, 8
  stages\, food trucks\, local vendors\, and thousands of music lovers welc
 oming the first sunrise of the year together.\n\nHosted across participati
 ng venues including DNA Lounge\, Butter\, BuzzWorks\, The Budda\, Bella\, 
 and outdoor street stages\, Sunrise Street Fest turns an iconic stretch of
  San Francisco into an all-day dance floor from dawn until dusk. Whether y
 ou're continuing the celebration from New Year's Eve or starting your year
  fresh under the morning sun\, this is your chance to be part of a histori
 c moment for the city's music scene.\n\nFirst-Ever Block Party on 11th Str
 eet\n100+ DJs\n8 Stages & Participating Venues\nFood Trucks & Vendors\nFRE
 E Admission 11th Street between Folsom & Harrison\n6AM - 8PM\n\n11th Stree
 t Folsom-Harrison in San Francisco\nOne street. One community. One unforge
 ttable way to begin the year\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/
 events/881241875011373/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/1/new
 -year-s-day-sunrise-street-festival-2027-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
